cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dashboard, please cite as below."
title: "E-BEWS USA — Hantavirus Digital Epidemiology Command Center"
authors:
  - family-names: Akshaya
abstract: >-
  An Environmental-Behavioral Early Warning System (E-BEWS) dashboard for
  Hantavirus that fuses Nielsen DMA-resolution Google Health Trends search
  probabilities with the ArcGIS Tracking_Hantavirus_2026 FeatureServer.
  Uses Grouped Expression Methodology to overcome k-anonymity suppression in
  rural Western US DMAs.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-12"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - digital epidemiology
  - infodemiology
  - hantavirus
  - andes virus
  - google health trends
  - nielsen DMA
  - early warning system
